#. Plugin Name of the plugin
#: ai-act-labels.php
msgid "AI Act Image Labels"
msgstr "AI Act Image Labels"

#. Description of the plugin
#: ai-act-labels.php
msgid "Marks AI-generated and AI-modified media as the EU AI Act asks – right in the media library, with the EU's official icons on the site, and an assistant that finds what needs a label."
msgstr "Označuje média vytvořená nebo upravená AI, jak vyžaduje akt EU o umělé inteligenci (AI Act) – přímo v knihovně médií, s oficiálními ikonami EU na webu a s asistentem, který najde, co potřebuje označení."

#. Author of the plugin
#: ai-act-labels.php
msgid "engenty"
msgstr "engenty"

#. Author URI of the plugin
#: ai-act-labels.php
msgid "https://engenty.ai"
msgstr "https://engenty.ai"

